  "title": "Juneteenth Celebration: Free Your Curls",
  "summary": "As a Black woman-owned business, cherishing and uplifting our community comes foremost in everything we do at NaturAll Club. This Juneteenth, we’re excited to celebrate the historic Juneteenth holiday with you all! In these trying times, we revel in the revolution of black joy, and encourage everyone to participate on June 19th!",
